name: capability-added
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: the platform surface gained a capability that did not exist —
  a new verb, a new host service, a declaration the runtime now honors.
  Distinct from repudiated-partial (a held belief was wrong) and
  capability-growth (the clay solver's parity surface widened): here
  nothing was measured or repudiated — the surface is simply larger.
  Minted by the std/build:app probe commit (embedded Info.plist →
  AppKit presents a real app name).
